Adventurer,

In the still air of a fall night, a stable door creaks open. Across the har=
d earth, four steps can be heard, and silhouetted against the moonlight swi=
ngs a cape. It must be=E2=80=A6 *Horsferatu* ( https://albiononline.com/new=
s/horsferatu ) !

A new referral season has crept upon us, and from now until December 1 you =
can claim this brand-new mount skin when you bring some fresh blood to Albi=
on (i.e. refer a friend). Transforming your *Riding Horse base mount* into =
the terrifying equine of legend with fanglike protrusions and blood-red sad=
dle, you will descend upon your enemies with a ruthless determination. And =
once you=E2=80=99ve unlocked this fearsome beast it can be used by *all cha=
racters* on your account.

( https://albiononline.com/news/harvest-challenge-2022 )

The Harvest Challenge Returns
-----------------------------

Fall has come to the world of Albion... the shadows are growing longer... a=
nd the *Harvest Challenge* ( https://albiononline.com/news/harvest-challeng=
e-2022 ) is back! For the entire month of October, earn points for open-wor=
ld activities, unlock chests to get valuable loot, and claim your very own =
*Spectral Bat*.

As always, you can earn Challenge Points by *gathering, fishing, farming, a=
nd killing monsters*. Points count simultaneously toward a daily bonus, a w=
eekly unlockable chest, and the monthly mount and avatar ring reward. So lo=
g in, head out into the open world, gather points, and claim these rewards =
while they last!

( https://albiononline.com/news/harvest-challenge-2022 )

The current referral season lasts until maintenance on *December 1* , so re=
fer a friend now and claim your rewards! Get more info here, including wher=
e to find your updated referral link:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/horsferatu )

